WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:06.009
QA opens a client whose only history is cancelled setups; the local mail sink is set to reject mail

2
00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:11.299
Provisioning runs; the invitation cannot be delivered

3
00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:28.590
The mail sink recovers; Retry delivers the original invitation once

4
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:33.693
Expiry (time fixture): the invitation is reported expired, distinct from delivery failure, with Resend

5
00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:42.270
Cancel the disposable setup and release its seat
